# Garmr public-export ALLOWLIST — top-level paths copied into the public tree.
# One path (file or dir) per line. Everything else is excluded by default.
# The export is tracked-files-only (via `git archive`), then the denylist is
# applied, then this allowlist is enforced as the final include set.
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
rust-toolchain.toml
deny.toml
.gitignore
.github
README.md
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE
LICENSES
NOTICE
